---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import marina from "../assets/images/marina.png";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="container">
    <div id="project-container">
      <section class="about">
        <h1>About</h1>

        <Image
          src={marina}
          alt="Portrait of Marina"
          class="about-photo"
        />

          <p>My background is in libraries, IT support, and technical writing. I started out working in public libraries, where I supported public computers, maintained websites and knowledge bases, documented troubleshooting steps, and helped librarians work through technical issues when immediate IT support wasn’t available.</p>

          <p>A lot of the people I worked with weren’t especially comfortable around technology, which made clear communication incredibly important. I spent a lot of time helping people troubleshoot problems, explain unfamiliar systems, or figure out why something suddenly stopped working.</p>

          <p>Even outside of work, I’ve usually been the person family, friends, and coworkers come to when something on their computer breaks. Technology and troubleshooting have been a consistent part of my life for a long time. I’ve also written beginner-friendly guides for HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, and some of the feedback that’s stayed with me most has come from people who said those guides made technical concepts feel less intimidating.</p>

          <p>I enjoy understanding how systems work in practice — where people get stuck, which questions keep coming up, and what information would actually make things easier. A lot of the work I naturally gravitate toward involves organizing messy information, improving documentation, or creating resources that help people solve problems more independently.</p>

          <p>Some of the work I’m most proud of has been the quieter, behind-the-scenes work: internal documentation, support resources, knowledge bases, and the kinds of systems people rely on every day without necessarily thinking about them. I like work that requires careful thinking, sustained focus, and attention to detail.</p>

          <p>These days, I’m especially drawn to longform writing and documentation projects. I enjoy making complex systems easier to understand and creating resources that remain useful over time.</p>

          <p>Outside of work, I enjoy reading, learning new tools and systems, and exploring the ways people interact with information and technology.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
</div>
</Layout>